              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontsize='12'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>- Only responses that completed the field: Did you find all the products you were looking for?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>- A few responses do not have a L1/L2 category assigned or have multiple categories because it is a recommendation based on the text field. If it was not possible to extract and define the category, it will be null</run>
